.TH TMELD-DUMP 1 "July 2026" "tmeld 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tmeld-dump \- print tmeld's chunk model for a comparison as JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tmeld-dump
\fIFILE\fR \fIFILE\fR [\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tmeld-dump
runs the vendored Meld diff engine on two or three files and prints
the resulting chunk model as JSON: per-chunk tags (insert, delete,
replace, conflict) and line ranges per pane. It is a debugging and
scripting aid for
.BR tmeld (1)
and produces no UI.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tmeld (1)
